      <p>Issued: 13 August 2026</p>
      <p>This release fixes some Common Vulnerabilities and Exposures (CVEs) and provides related Red Hat advisories.</p>
      <p>The following advisories are available for the External Secrets Operator for Red Hat OpenShift:</p>
